                <pb facs="0186" n="166" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg166"/>

                <head>[Extract from Galignani.]</head>
                <p>General Count de Thun has arrived in Paris, charged by the Mexican government to
                    come to an arrangement with the Transatlantic Steam Navigation Company for the
                    conveyance to Vera Cruz of 4,200 volunteers, enlisted in Austria.</p>
            </div>
